"""Screen Spawner: a small window and top bar icon to run Hermes for a tablet.

It starts and stops Hermes, pairs a tablet or phone by the PIN Moonlight shows
and gives it the permissions it needs, gives each device a screen of its own
or lets it mirror a monitor, removes paired devices, opens the Hermes Web UI
and starts the uninstaller.

It talks to Hermes through its local API with the token Hermes publishes in
$XDG_RUNTIME_DIR/hermes/local-api.token, so no Web UI password is needed.
"""

